id: pm-rust-lock-gc-receipt-ttl
title: Use the persisted lease TTL when recommending lock GC
description: "The published 2026.11.18 acquireLock uses the configured TTL for acquisition, then checks the incumbent receipt TTL before recommending GC. A two-hour-old receipt with a 24-hour receipt TTL and a 30-minute acquisition TTL yields stale_lock_requires_override with owner-verified manual guidance. Native guidance checks the receipt shape and timestamp but still recommends GC for this case."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
